# Working in this repo

- Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/behaviour.md](../../docs/behaviour.md) before you edit.
- Follow [How a change happens](../../AGENTS.md#how-a-change-happens), including the issue and pull request templates in `.github/`.
- One issue, one branch, one pull request. Stay inside the current issue.
- An issue title starts with one emoji code, such as 🛠️ or 📄. A pull request title is a plain sentence.
- Roxana reviews and merges.
- Every change to how the assistant behaves must match [docs/behaviour.md](../../docs/behaviour.md).
- Never change [docs/agreements.md](../../docs/agreements.md), and never weaken a test to make it pass.
- Maple Street Plumbing is a demo front desk. Do not describe it as a real client.
